    <string name="privacy_body">Muslim ej kautiej am melele im jab bōk melele ko am. kōllaajrake ien jar ko im qibla eo ilo device eo am, im rejjab jilkinlok ñan jabdrewot server eo ilikin.\n• Mālim ko wōt ñe emenin aikuj: jej kajjitōk mālim ko (jikin, kōjjelā ko) wōt ñe juon men ej aikuji, ippāñ juon melele ealikar.\n• Ejelok kōppeļaak: app eo ej jerbal offline; kōjerbal network eo ej juon men eo ejjab aikuj in kōmmane ñan men ko jet einwot bōk recitation ko.\n\nPolisi in ej mõttan open-source repository eo im ej bellok ñan an armij ro lale.</string>
